{% extends "letter.tex.jinja" %}


{% block signature %}
{{ inviter.name|nobreak }}
{% endblock %}


{% block addressor %}
{{ inviter.name|nobreak }} \\
{{ inviter.address|address_block }} \\[1ex]
{{ inviter.phone|phone }} \\[1ex]
{{ inviter.email }} \\
{% endblock %}


{% block addressee %}
{{ embassy.name|nobreak }} \\
{{ embassy.address|address_block }}
{% endblock %}


{% block body %}
\opening{Dear Visa Officer,}

I would like to confirm that my {{ invitee.relationship }}, {{ invitee.name|names }}, will{% if invitee.name|length > 1 %} each{% endif %} apply for a UK Standard Visitor visa. {{ invitee.pronoun.subject.capitalize() }} will travel to the United~Kingdom from {{ trip.arrival_date|date }} until {{ trip.departure_date|date }}{% if trip.reason %} for {{ trip.reason }}{% endif %}.

{{ invitee.name|first_names }} will stay with me at my home, {{ inviter.address|address_inline }}, free of charge.
{% if trip.financial_support %}
I will pay for {{ invitee.pronoun.determiner }} return journey and all of {{ invitee.pronoun.determiner }} costs during the visit.
{% else %}
{{ invitee.pronoun.subject.capitalize() }} will pay for {{ invitee.pronoun.determiner }} own travel and living costs.
{% endif %}

While in the UK, {{ invitee.pronoun.subject }} will not do paid or unpaid work for a UK company or as a self-employed person, or access public funds.

{% if trip.return_country or trip.return_reason %}
After {{ invitee.pronoun.determiner }} trip to the UK, {{ invitee.name|first_names }} will {% if trip.return_country %}return to {{ trip.return_country }}{% else %}leave the UK{% endif %}{% if trip.return_reason %} {{ trip.return_reason }}{% endif %}.
{% endif %}

{% if inviter.status %}
I am {{ inviter.status }}.
{% endif %}
{% if employer %}
I am currently employed at {{ employer.name|nobreak }}, {{ employer.address|address_inline }}.
{% endif %}

{% if inviter.residence or employer or trip.financial_support or inviter.proof_of_address or docs %}
I have enclosed the following documents:
\begin{itemize}
{% if inviter.residence == "permit" %} \item residence permit
{% elif inviter.residence == "share code" %} \item eVisa share code
{% elif inviter.residence == "passport" %} \item passport
{% elif inviter.residence %} \item {{ inviter.residence }}
{% endif %}
{% if employer %} \item employment reference {% endif %}
{% if trip.financial_support %} \item recent bank statements
{% if employer %} \item recent payslips {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if inviter.proof_of_address %} \item proof of address: {{ inviter.proof_of_address }} {% endif %}
{% for doc in docs %}
\item {{ doc }}
{% endfor %}
\end{itemize}
{% endif %}

Should you wish to discuss this application further, please do not hesitate to contact me.

\closing{Best regards,}
{% endblock %}
